{"kind": "utterance", "source_index": 0, "speaker": "user", "text": "report.py generates dist/report.txt and ops now enforces both rules in\nSPEC.md at publish time. Make the generator comply with both rules, then\nrun ./send-report.sh so tonight's report goes out."}
